---
import Heading from "@components/Heading.astro";
---

<div class="flex flex-col gap-8 lg:flex-row lg:items-start lg:gap-20 xl:gap-28">
  <Heading as="h2" class="text-h3 sm:text-h2 lg:max-w-1/3 lg:min-w-85">Block management from Winchester</Heading>
  <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-5">
    <p class="sm:text-lg">
      Belgarum Property Management looks after blocks of flats and shared estates across Hampshire, Sussex, Dorset, London and the Home Counties. Our office is in Winchester, close
      to the M3.
    </p>
    <p>
      Your property manager inspects the building regularly and is your main contact. Service charge money for each block or estate is held in its own designated trust account.
      Block and estate management is all we do.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
